Z||000004||Raydar||03-18-2000||02:35 PM||||If the weather strip at the front edge of the deck lid is still there, there is the largest possibility that the recall was not done. This was removed as part of the recall. ||||reg||1
Z||000005||86SE||03-18-2000||04:24 PM||||Was the '86 SE V-6 recalled??  Because I still have the weatherstrip.||||reg||5
Z||000006||mshill||03-19-2000||03:15 AM||||86SE, yes the 86SE V6 had two recalls as I recall (no pun).  One had tot do with the emergency brake, and the other with the front manifold and breather tube from the front valve cover.  There are several sites on the net from which you can search for recall info.<BR>||||reg||1
